<Base title="About — Alaa Ahmad" description="Meet Alaa Ahmad, a Riyadh-based junior UI/UX designer with more than six years in quality assurance and customer experience."><section class="page-intro wrap"><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PIXELS · RIYADH, SAUDI ARABIA</span><h1>Curiosity is my <em>favorite tool.</em></h1><p>I'm Alaa, a junior UI/UX designer combining an analytical background in customer experience with a passion for clear, human-centered products.</p></section><section class="about-content wrap"><div class="about-monogram" aria-hidden="true">a<span>.</span></div><div><span class="eyebrow">MY STORY</span><h2>From understanding experiences to <em>designing them.</em></h2><p>Before transitioning into UI/UX, I spent more than six years working in quality assurance and customer experience. That background taught me how to identify friction, evaluate customer journeys, collaborate across teams, and turn observations into practical improvements.</p><p>Today, I apply that same curiosity to digital products. My design work spans mobile app concepts, information architecture, user flows, and UX audits. I care about the questions behind the screens: What does someone need to accomplish? What makes the experience confusing? How can we make the next step feel obvious?</p><p>I'm based in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, and continuing to grow my design practice through hands-on projects and continuous learning.</p><span class="eyebrow">WHAT I WORK WITH</span><div class="skills">{['UX Audits','Customer Experience','Information Architecture','User Flows','Wireframing','UI Design','Prototyping','Figma','FigJam'].map(s=><span>{s}</span>)}</div><a href="/contact" class="text-link">Let's connect ↗</a></div></section></Base>